segment.source:
::Mister Patterson,

Even though I have already told you that we do NOT have the appropriate facilities to store this kind of material, you proceeded with shipping anyway. Though I understand that we must be flexible these days and it's to be expected that some safety protocol must be overlooked if we are to contain the chaos caused by the events down below, we simply cannot store this kind of bio-hazardous substance. I expect you to arrange for it to be shipped to a more appropriate storage as soon as possible.

Horace Montgomery::&lt;end&gt;

